Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 20:49:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] School curriculum: download 136 real PDFs and verify 95
 catalogue books

Download every Drive PDF from the Iraqi curriculum manifest into
uploads/school-curriculum with size+SHA-256+PDF-header checks. Map primary
textbooks onto the 108-row catalogue and set verified/available/file.url only
for real on-disk matches (95). Leave unmatched extras and missing literary
rows pending. Add page-window outlines and reader path coverage.
